WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:06,140
Mr. Wu, we have done a lot of things that King Zuo Xian ordered us to do.

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:10,330
The number of people who have died in our hands in the past few days must be at least forty or fifty.

3
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,330
Not bad. Our mission is simple.

4
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:15,330
Shoot everyone around you

5
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:17,330
Prevent them from running to Shazhou City to avoid trouble.

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:20,330
At the same time, Shazhou City will not be allowed to grow bigger again.

7
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,330
Fortunately, I can withstand these three years.

8
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:26,330
But when our army comes next time, I think he can hold off for a few more years.

9
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,330
Now he can't even fight a standing horse.

10
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:30,390
Even if you want to come and beat us

11
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,390
He won't be here for a while

12
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,390
I'm afraid he'll be exhausted by the time he arrives

13
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:40,390
Mr. Wu, let’s go back to the military camp then.

14
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:42,390
Can I be promoted to Centurion?

15
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:43,390
You damn centurion

16
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:45,390
It would be great if you could be a master palmer

17
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,390
Master Palm is not bad either

18
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:47,390
As long as you can be an official
